Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.05,0:00:03.42,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.57,0:00:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name's Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.57,0:00:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.96,0:00:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你听说过我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you have heard of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.32,0:00:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能实现你的任何愿望 同志\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give you anything you want, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而我只要 - 我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All I need is… - My soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.01,0:00:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你出卖了自己的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sold your soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.14,0:00:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 典当更贴切些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, more like pawned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.46,0:00:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我完全乐意将它归还 - 好啊 那马上还来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I fully intend to give it back. - Well, then give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.65,0:00:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 是不行还是不愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can't. - Can't or won't?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.22,0:00:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不愿意 行了吗 那是我的保险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't, all right? It's insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.22,0:00:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲁弗斯·特纳 猎魔人 - 是你的老友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rufus Turner. He's a hunter. - One of your old friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.82,0:00:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友 他可绝不是友善之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friend? He's not the christmas-card type.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.35,0:00:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 我是乔迪·米尔斯警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen. I'm sheriff Jody Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.11,0:00:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我们之前没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe we've had the pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是威利斯探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Willis speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.43,0:00:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲍比吗 - 老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bobby? - Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.92,0:00:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说你认识鲍比·辛格\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you know Bobby Singer?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.96,0:00:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 警长不是很讨厌你么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, I thought the sheriff hated you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.25,0:00:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到五天前她确实很恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did till five days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.14,0:00:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,五天前发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened five days ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.61,0:00:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个镇上开始出现丧尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dead started rising all over town.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.25,0:00:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 你就打算坐那儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, you just gonna sit there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.95,0:00:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我正准备跳大河之舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm gonna riverdance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.43,0:00:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真是太妄费十字路口的交易了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really wasted that crossroads deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.33,0:00:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,天杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.49,0:00:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 拜托 我可是十字路口之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello … king of the crossroads.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.75,0:00:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.06,0:00:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我好得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}yeah, I'm great.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.25,0:00:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有那么几次 你让我觉得很纳闷\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause there's been a few times that you got me wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.50,0:01:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总觉得你有点儿不一样了 - 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something's different with you. - I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可是去过地狱的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went to hell, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.28,0:01:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天 加尔维斯顿海岸受到十英尺高的海浪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday, this Galveston shoreline was being pounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.28,0:01:10.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加尔维斯顿 得克萨斯州）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.20,0:01:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,和风速达每小时150米的飓风袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}by 10-foot swells and winds up to 150 miles per hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.43,0:01:16.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一年前）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.53,0:01:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而今天却是万里无云\N{\fnArial\fs30}But today, well, there's not a cloud in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.23,0:01:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂芬尼飓风登陆海湾之后就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurricane Tiffany has broken up over the gulf,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.02,0:01:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据我们的5日短期预报\N{\fnArial\fs30}and our 5-day forecast calls for nothing…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.49,0:01:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来几天都将风和日丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but sun and clear skies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.87,0:01:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来上帝很中意我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess somebody up there likes us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.98,0:01:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.87,0:01:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直都玩得很开心哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been making merry, have we?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.78,0:01:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,死吧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.04,0:01:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到你还好那口\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's your thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.07,0:01:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆那华丽的一跳真是太完美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That swan dive of Sam's was a thing of beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.69,0:01:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,表现绝佳 世人赞扬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tens all the way 'round,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.38,0:01:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,让路同学白忙了一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}standing "O" from the romanian judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.79,0:01:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该引以为傲的 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be proud, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.29,0:02:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就死亡而言 那可一点儿也不寒酸啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}As deaths go, it wasn't too shabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.23,0:02:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,振作点啊 同志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheer up, mate!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.38,0:02:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱一起拯救了这该死的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just saved the sodding world together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.98,0:02:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直在庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been celebrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.69,0:02:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点都不想看见你是怎么庆祝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to see what you call "Celebrating."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.10,0:02:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,也对 你肯定不待见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.74,0:02:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,来一杯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.17,0:02:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.79,0:02:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我搞搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.33,0:02:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚刚「一起拯救了这该死的世界」\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just "Saved the sodding world together, "
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.89,0:02:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你竟然不乐意跟我共饮一杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're too good to drink with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.62,0:02:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.47,0:02:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我怀疑你这儿没我喜欢的牌子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I doubt that you have my brand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.43,0:02:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,您想喝什么酒呢 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your poison, your highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.70,0:02:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷格 至少得是30年陈酿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Craig, aged 30 years, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.01,0:02:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,小学起我就一直喝它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been drinking it since grade school.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.86,0:02:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只有陈年的劣质威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got old rotgut…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.93,0:02:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,陈酿六天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aged six days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.79,0:02:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,老灌这种酒只会让你的灵魂更加空虚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swill like that is gonna burn a hole in your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.31,0:02:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 抱歉 我的灵魂才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry … my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.12,0:02:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这才是你召唤我的真正原因吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's why you called …
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.61,0:02:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关我们的小交易对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}our little…deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.43,0:02:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.25,0:02:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候履行你的诺言了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about time you hold up your end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.90,0:02:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,把灵魂还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.94,0:02:58.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:03:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our deal was…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.20,0:03:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们封印路西法 你就把交易停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}we ice Lucifer, you rip up the lease.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.23,0:03:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没好好看你的合约\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't read your contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的说什么合约呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell you talking about, contract?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.06,0:03:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,第18段的B部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paragraph 18, subsection "B, "
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,印在你私密部位上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is on your naughty bits …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要「尽最大努力」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only have to make "Best efforts"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.49,0:03:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,归还你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}to give you back your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.84,0:03:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.65,0:03:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.30,0:03:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常乐意归还\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.86,0:03:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但却无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.92,0:03:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个满嘴跑火车的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lying sack of …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.64,0:03:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,十年后\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 years…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.56,0:03:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就得下地狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come to daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.15,0:03:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前 我建议你喝点好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till then, I suggest you start drinking the good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.12,0:03:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figured you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.31,0:03:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以在你改变主意之前别想离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can rot here until you change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.77,0:03:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么 因为你低声下气求我吗 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? 'cause you asked nicely? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我给你下个了套\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'm going "dateline" on your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.51,0:03:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望这是油漆绘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope that's paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.55,0:03:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没搞错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.87,0:03:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么办捏\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.57,0:04:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗狗的气息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doggy breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.20,0:04:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很清新 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bracing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.28,0:04:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是你决定的时候了 罗伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ball's in your court, Robert.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.33,0:04:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是十年的平静生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 years of living…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.30,0:04:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是当十年的狗粮\N{\fnArial\fs30}or 10 years as alpo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.21,0:04:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事儿没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.38,0:04:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是绝对不会改变主意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't have it any other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.28,0:04:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝猎魔快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.23,0:05:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第6季第4集]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.95,0:05:09.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（基诺沙县 威斯康辛州 如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.34,0:05:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有电磁反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}No EMF.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.28,0:05:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体有什么线索吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find anything in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.83,0:05:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我找到了个爪子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got some kind of claw.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.29,0:05:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么东西的爪子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the hell has a claw like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.94,0:05:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.46,0:05:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说不定上厕所呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's in the can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.61,0:05:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.34,0:05:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 咋了 你摔地上爬不起来了么 - 不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened, you fall and can't get up? - Hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.05,0:05:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有屁快放 - 我们在威斯康辛州\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's up? - We're in Wisconsin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.55,0:05:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,六具尸体 胸腔被挖开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six bodies, chests cracked wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.83,0:05:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有电磁反应 没有硫磺也没有巫术袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}No EMF, no sulfur, no hex bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.58,0:05:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还发现了这个 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did find this, though. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.43,0:05:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 看你的电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, check your wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.61,0:06:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这倒是没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.74,0:06:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你尽快查清楚这是啥东西的爪子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we need an I.D. Asap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.59,0:06:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西可到处撒野呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing's on a rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.11,0:06:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有线索了就打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call as soon as you dig something up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.44,0:06:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我有点忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I'm a little busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.91,0:06:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快从你的软香温玉里起来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then kick bo derek out of your bathtub.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.55,0:06:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在办正事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a case here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.30,0:06:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我电话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.64,0:06:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,操蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.10,0:06:35.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（苏福尔斯大学图书馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.67,0:06:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点发动啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.22,0:06:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞毛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.61,0:07:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,操蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们遇见的是女妖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are hunting a lamia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.85,0:07:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.51,0:07:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一种怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.71,0:07:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃人心 喝人血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Juices hearts, chugs the blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.19,0:07:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没听说过这东西出现在希腊之外的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never heard of one popping up outside of Greece, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.73,0:07:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怪物貌似移民了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, looks like this freak has immigrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.00,0:07:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑来威斯康星州吃人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's snacking on cheese-heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.56,0:07:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何对策\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we gank it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.66,0:07:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a couple of ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.55,0:08:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,最方便的是被神父开过光的银制刀具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easiest is a silver knife blessed by a padre.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.57,0:08:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.82,0:08:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,兔崽子 不用谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.07,0:08:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在这儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! I'm still here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.88,0:08:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 暴脾气大叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there, cranky.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.57,0:08:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去那么久 我还以为你酒精中毒昏倒了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were gone so long, I just assumed alcoholic coma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.92,0:08:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们说到哪里了 - 你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where were we? - Your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.88,0:08:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.13,0:08:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.22,0:08:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧你 手忙脚乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you … all in a rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.60,0:08:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有前戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Foreplay…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.93,0:08:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,才有高潮嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}gets you more play.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.30,0:08:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,把克劳力的名字告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want Crowley's name …
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.80,0:08:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真正的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}his real name,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.19,0:08:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是人类时候的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}back when he was flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.98,0:08:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,把恶魔绑在你的地下室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does tying demons up in your basement make you feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是能减轻你杀害妻子的罪恶感\N{\fnArial\fs30}about that time you killed your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.89,0:08:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不认识吗 是你的东西呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't recognize them? They're yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.57,0:09:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是个传说而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.55,0:09:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就无须多虑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you got nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.28,0:09:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法想象他会怎样对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what he'll do to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.62,0:09:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在你面临的是我 - 你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right now, you better worry about me. - You don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.28,0:09:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是王\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.63,0:09:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,十字路口之王 这我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}King of the crossroads … I've heard the speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.20,0:09:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}King of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.42,0:09:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不去开门吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna get that or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.78,0:10:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,马西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.41,0:10:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲍比·辛格 我们做邻居多久了 - 六个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bobby Singer, how long have we been neighbors? - Six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.16,0:10:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在是不是应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't you think it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.25,0:10:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎我成为你的邻居了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you welcomed me to the neighborhood?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最拿手的生姜蜜桃馅饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}My famous ginger-peach cobbler.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.44,0:10:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻一下 我可是个天才厨师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a whiff. Seriously, I'm a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊 来人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.67,0:10:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.71,0:10:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,无聊的恐怖电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}stupid horror flicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.75,0:10:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有恐怖片情结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guilty pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.61,0:10:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我超爱恐怖电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love scary movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.46,0:10:39.16,Title,0,0,0,0,,你看《堕入地狱》没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, have you seen "Drag me to hell"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,能免则免吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to avoid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.74,0:10:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是真的很赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,星期六 七点 来我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saturday, 7:00, my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.11,0:10:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你做晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fix you dinner,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.10,0:10:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会做一些拿手的白巧克力爆米花\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll whip up a batch of my famous white-chocolate popcorn,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.35,0:10:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们边吃边看\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.49,0:10:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.38,0:10:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不错 马西 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sounds super, Marcy, but, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.69,0:11:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, no worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.63,0:11:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, hey, one other thing …
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.37,0:11:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的碎木机 真是一坨废铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, my wood chipper … it's a piece of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.31,0:11:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道怎么就坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it just broke down on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.65,0:11:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说你挺能干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and … and I hear that you're quite handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.91,0:11:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能过来 帮我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you could come over and…take a look …
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便什么时候都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, just whenever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.93,0:11:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我尽力而为吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'll see what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.17,0:11:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.60,0:11:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.80,0:11:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.31,0:11:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去人不错哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw! She sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.72,0:11:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 你要先和她大干一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna make sweet love to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.53,0:11:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,再把她杀死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you stab her to death, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.82,0:11:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你通常不都这么干么\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is your usual thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我克劳力的真名\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want Crowley's name now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.22,0:12:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 克劳力的真名 - 我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crowley's name! - Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.15,0:12:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.84,0:12:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克劳德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Macleod.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.18,0:12:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,费格斯·麦克劳德 我发誓是真名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fergus Macleod. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.63,0:12:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在背后叫他幸运妖精\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call him Lucky The Leprechaun behind his back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.74,0:12:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克劳德是苏格兰名字 天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Macleod's Scottish, Einstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.04,0:12:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得偿所愿了 现在送我回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got what you want. Now send me back …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.82,0:12:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.35,0:12:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们说好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.65,0:12:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我心有余而力不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gave it my best effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.26,0:12:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.72,0:12:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,加思 有啥情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Garth, what do you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.66,0:12:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未听说过吸血鬼会那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never heard of a vamp doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.55,0:12:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那应该不关我们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't sound like our kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好把这事儿告诉联邦调查局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better drop a dime to the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.08,0:12:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,威利斯 联邦调查局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willis. FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.57,0:12:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 加思 不是打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Garth, not me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.75,0:12:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是打给真正的联邦调查局\N{\fnArial\fs30}the FBI. The real FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.05,0:12:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么活到现在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.63,0:13:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是坎索尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.22,0:13:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,请说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.55,0:13:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是威利斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Willis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.10,0:13:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她当然是我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh. Of course she's one of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.52,0:13:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她想要去挖那个坟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if she says she's got to dig that grave up,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}you better damn well let her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.40,0:13:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 你在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good, you're home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你得帮我埋个尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you got to help me bury a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.68,0:13:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛把它带到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you bring it here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.07,0:13:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,条子们抓我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The law is on my tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.99,0:13:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你以为呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was your guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.81,0:13:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛 他们走运而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What? What? They got lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 要不就是你身手变慢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, or you're getting slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.12,0:13:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身手变慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话还是从“全职接线员”嘴里说出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, says Mr."Sits on his ass all day taking calls."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.14,0:13:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸血鬼 变形怪 还是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vamp? Shifter? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.97,0:13:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of the above.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.14,0:13:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼神吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okami?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.79,0:13:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪里解决它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you shiv it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.88,0:13:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好啊 比林斯（位于蒙大拿州）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this … Billings.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.39,0:13:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一一次遇见狼神还是在日本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only time I ever saw one of these was in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.72,0:13:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人在日本以外看到过他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duh … no one's ever seen one of these except in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.27,0:14:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便一提\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what it's worth,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.23,0:14:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和迪恩在威斯康星州追踪一个女妖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean are tracking a Lamia in Wisconsin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.16,0:14:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧 他们不是只在希腊活动么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out. I thought they never leave Greece.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.94,0:14:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物最近都\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsters lately …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.85,0:14:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我多想了 还是本来就很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}is it me, or is it weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次肯定出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, it's… definitely something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.09,0:14:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有铲子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you got a shovel?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.63,0:14:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我光明节的礼物就要这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man! I know what I want for hanukkah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.62,0:14:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说 那混蛋叫费格斯·麦克劳德\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the son of a bitch's name is Fergus Macleod?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.44,0:14:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这就是他的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the son of a bitch's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.15,0:14:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要从哪儿找起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you gonna look?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.94,0:14:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏格兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scotland.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.71,0:14:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力无意中提到他喜欢喝克雷格酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley let slip that he likes Craig.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.21,0:14:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一种\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.33,0:14:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏格兰威士忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Scotch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只在凯思内斯郡最北部的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only made and sold in a tiny area.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.84,0:14:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小部分地区酝酿以及销售\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the north tip of Caithness county.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.95,0:14:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒丝浓郁 辣劲十足\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's peaty and sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.21,0:14:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,余味是柑橘和烟草的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a long finish of citrus and tobacco notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.89,0:15:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 我难道是一个粗人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what? What am I, a heathen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.61,0:15:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道克雷格这种酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what Craig is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.37,0:15:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got a hunch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.97,0:15:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当克劳力还是人类的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's where Crowley lived and died,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.21,0:15:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是在那里度过一生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}back when he was a human …
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.73,0:15:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他从地狱里浴火重生成为恶魔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few hundred years before he got the big squeeze in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.45,0:15:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,几百年之前吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and came out a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.74,0:15:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在那边有熟人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I got contacts over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.71,0:15:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以打几个电话问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can make a few calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.12,0:15:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没要你帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't asking for no help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.44,0:15:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不必尊求你的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking you your permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.03,0:15:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.60,0:15:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么办法可以杀了女妖\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's another way to kill a lamia?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.05,0:15:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那把神父祝福过的银刀不管用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what happened to the silver knife blessed by a priest?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.36,0:15:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}That didn't pan out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.93,0:15:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有后备计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's plan "B"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.40,0:15:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.49,0:15:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 操蛋 - 拜托 鲍比 快点说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Balls! - Come on, Bobby. Get the lead out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.17,0:15:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在哪儿 - 教堂 教区长的家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are you? - The church … in a rectory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.11,0:15:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有厨房吗 - 有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is there a kitchen? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.14,0:15:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到盐和迷迭香\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find salt and rosemary.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.71,0:16:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开门 辛格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open up, Singer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.28,0:16:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛格先生 我是亚当斯探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Singer, I'm Agent Adams.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.37,0:16:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你肯定认识米尔斯警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you know Sheriff Mills.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我跟我妈打电话呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom. Just a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.23,0:16:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迷迭香我找到了 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rosemary! I got it! - Great, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.14,0:16:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它和盐搅拌 高温加热\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now blend the herbs, sauté over a high heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.45,0:16:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cook well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.49,0:16:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆 要点火啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy! Fire in the hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.84,0:16:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, great, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.45,0:16:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢享用烤肉吧 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the roast, mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.20,0:16:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过这个男人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.66,0:16:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁弗斯·特纳 又称卢瑟·范德罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus Turner, AKA Luther Vandross,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.73,0:16:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,又称鲁本·斯达德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aka Ruben Studdard?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.48,0:16:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 没见过这个傻叉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Never seen that dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.00,0:16:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道他是个傻叉\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you know he's a dick?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.20,0:16:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.54,0:16:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.50,0:16:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几个在公路上工作的朋友告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause I got a couple guys working the highway,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.23,0:16:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看见他到你这儿来了 还带了一具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}said they saw him pull in here, carrying a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.50,0:16:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.04,0:16:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是工作日 我得去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's a work day. I got to …
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.11,0:16:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只想搜查下你的屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just want to take a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.60,0:17:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有搜查令吗 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a warrant, sonny?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.29,0:17:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我用不着 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, do I need one…Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.85,0:17:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了伙计们 别整官僚这套 都少说两句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fellas, put the rulers away. Zip up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.78,0:17:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 鲍比他确实是个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Bobby here's kind of a…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,急脾气\N{\fnArial\fs30}crank.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也绝对不是个政府拥护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he ain't what you call a fan of big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.13,0:17:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我和他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But me and him …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.25,0:17:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我逮捕你有几年了 十年吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long I been arresting you now, 10 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.39,0:17:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.24,0:17:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有点交情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we got a history.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.24,0:17:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说让我来搜查他的屋子怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you say you just let me scope the place out?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.83,0:17:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吗 你可以在外面等\N{\fnArial\fs30}That okay? You can just wait outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.09,0:17:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,就五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.94,0:17:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.77,0:17:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛把他赶到外面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you send him outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.25,0:17:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不觉得你想把他留在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I didn't think you'd want him in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.64,0:17:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实 我地下室里有具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't. I've got a body in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.43,0:17:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.46,0:17:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我在后院里还埋了一具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I've got another body buried in the yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.81,0:17:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.08,0:17:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.58,0:17:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,操蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.68,0:18:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛格先生 请过来一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Singer, come with me please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你介意解释一下这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind explaining this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.66,0:18:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,咋的了 化粪池爆炸不行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you never had a septic tank explode on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.37,0:18:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经好好清理过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it pretty well cleaned up,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.69,0:18:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还是注意下你脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}but watch where you step.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.71,0:18:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给我回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.71,0:18:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,回个毛 我都开了两个州了 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back … I'm two states over, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't …
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.04,0:18:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个狼神没有死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The okami ain't dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.83,0:18:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,它当然死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你用竹制匕首了吗 - 用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you use a bamboo dagger? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.58,0:18:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是被神道牧师祝福过的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blessed by a shinto priest?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.00,0:18:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又不是弱智 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not an imbecile, bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.36,0:18:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刺了七次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you stab it seven times?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.63,0:18:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是五次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five times.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.54,0:18:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是七次\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.39,0:18:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我很确定是五次\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm pretty sure it's five.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.93,0:18:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 是七次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, clearly it's seven times.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.90,0:18:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个挖的洞空了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The damn hole is empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.85,0:18:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到它的时候它在袭击什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it feeding on when you found it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.73,0:18:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,单身的白人女性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Single, white females…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.26,0:18:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁她们睡觉的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}while they slept.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.11,0:19:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.68,0:19:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的房间在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your bedroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.28,0:19:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 我尽量不抓狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, I am trying to keep my cool here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.84,0:19:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿着散弹枪在我家干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing in my house with a shotgun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.65,0:19:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看没看见啥奇怪的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you see anything… Weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.97,0:19:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,除你之外吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean besides you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.93,0:20:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.80,0:20:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.80,0:20:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.43,0:20:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你家切碎机不是坏了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought your chipper was broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.10,0:21:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就这么一说 好让你过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just said that to get you over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.93,0:21:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.17,0:21:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.25,0:21:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我倒是能来吃个饭啥的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I could come over for dinner some night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.09,0:21:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,会蛮有趣的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.07,0:21:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看还是算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.92,0:21:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生活一直这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Story of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.18,0:21:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还喘气呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still alive, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.59,0:21:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这么大惊小怪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't act so surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.30,0:21:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那女魔头怎么样了 - 干掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How about godzilla? - Put her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.60,0:21:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会刚好手边放着\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you just happened to have a bamboo dagger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.71,0:21:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一把开了光的竹制匕首吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}blessed by a shinto priest laying around?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.90,0:21:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是切碎机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wood chipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.85,0:21:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样子啊 切碎机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okeydokey. Wood chipper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.27,0:21:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这东西 估计啥都顶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That … that pretty much trumps…Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.65,0:21:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, uh, Bobby, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.43,0:21:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.48,0:21:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.56,0:21:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.02,0:21:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,计较起来 我欠你的比你欠我的多多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure I still owe you more than you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.71,0:22:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧 你现在又要多欠我个人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}All righty. Then add one more thing to the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.58,0:22:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有克劳力的消息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a lead on your boy Crowley …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.62,0:22:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,又称费格斯·罗利克·麦克劳德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aka Fergus Rodric Macleod,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.87,0:22:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,祖籍苏格兰凯思内斯 1661年生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Born in Canisbay, Scotland … 1661.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.69,0:22:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 这能有啥用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. I don't know what that's gonna get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.84,0:22:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 下面这个 老鲍\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, then, behind door number two, Bob…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.39,0:22:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力有个儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley had a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.20,0:22:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.22,0:22:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他叫加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, name of Gavin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.41,0:22:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他父母过世后便往来于大西洋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moved across the pond after his parents bit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.30,0:22:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥一艘商船\N{\fnArial\fs30}and captained a trading ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.76,0:22:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,1723年在马萨诸塞州死后下了地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}That went down in Massachusetts in 1723.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.26,0:22:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,约三十年前 一帮疯狂的海洋学家找到了残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple of Cousteau wannabes found the wreck about 30 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.88,0:22:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们找到了他的尸骨吗 - 没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They fish out his bones? - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.85,0:22:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但找到了他的图章戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did find his signet ring, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.72,0:22:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现作为「深海宝藏」系列展的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's part of the "Treasures from the deep" Exhibit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.98,0:22:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在安多弗德海洋博物馆展出\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the Maritime Museum in Andover.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.84,0:22:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要那枚戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need that ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.90,0:22:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呦喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.96,0:22:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是在求我吗 老鲍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, are you, um … you asking for my help, bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.14,0:22:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.59,0:22:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不过是要枚戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking for a ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.15,0:22:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要能帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…I'd appreciate your…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.92,0:22:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会很领情的\N{\fnArial\fs30}help getting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.79,0:23:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,早替你想好了 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm way ahead of you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.02,0:23:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这就去安多弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm headed for Andover now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.18,0:23:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概午夜就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be there around midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.53,0:23:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.60,0:23:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是打算交换人质 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're thinking hostage exchange, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.21,0:23:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到戒指后召唤他儿子的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, get the ring, you can summon junior's ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.10,0:23:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,捉到鬼魂 和克劳力换回你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the ghost, you can swap Crowley his son for your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.68,0:23:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多这意思吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.58,0:23:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿能成功吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hope that works out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.61,0:23:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.35,0:23:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好 那女妖的事挺顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, the Lamia grilled up fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.48,0:23:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听着话音儿不对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sense a "But" coming on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.30,0:23:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是萨姆 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Sam, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.94,0:24:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是感觉他变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just … he's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.31,0:24:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, and I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.38,0:24:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有过那样的经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go through something like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.62,0:24:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,人是会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}And … and you change.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.87,0:24:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.60,0:24:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是觉得不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's not right to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.71,0:24:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 那一年里好多事我都想不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean … I've got a few questions about that year …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.08,0:24:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在他身边 而我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you saw him and I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.70,0:24:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我又来一电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I got another call.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.81,0:24:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啥 - 稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You what? - Just hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.79,0:24:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这电话我得接 很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to take this. It's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.06,0:24:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥事比萨姆还重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}More important than Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.35,0:24:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.78,0:24:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁弗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rufus?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.66,0:24:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 好消息是我拿到戒指了 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The good news is I snagged the ring, Bobby. However …
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.92,0:24:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是吧 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell me that ain't - Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.43,0:24:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你猜三下谁在追我 先把医务人员排除吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three guesses, and one of 'em … it ain't the paramedics.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.36,0:24:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说鲍比 我得找个地方藏这戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Bobby, I-I got to stash this ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.16,0:24:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,可别吞下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't swallow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.77,0:24:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吧 鲍比 这就吞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. I'm swallowing it, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.55,0:24:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说别吞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't swallow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.24,0:24:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.52,0:24:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.88,0:24:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来 从车上下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on the ground! Out of the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.21,0:24:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有权利的 妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know my rights, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.25,0:25:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 还在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still there, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.44,0:25:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 你搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.53,0:25:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.76,0:25:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you are the one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.21,0:25:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能跟你一个人说\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I can talk to about this stuff …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.68,0:25:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆的事 还有丢下莉莎和本\N{\fnArial\fs30}About … about Sam, about leaving Lisa and Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.62,0:25:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说 我现在都不知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I don't … I don't even know which way is up right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.12,0:25:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.73,0:25:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.95,0:25:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听着呢 孩子 只是现在不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I hear you, son. I-it just ain't a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.77,0:25:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 那个啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.06,0:25:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.49,0:25:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿跟他妈个姑娘似的吐槽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm baring my soul like a freaking girl here,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.51,0:25:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也有自己的事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh … and you've got stuff to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.61,0:25:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 没关系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that is … that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.66,0:25:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事儿 不过说真的 你这样挺自私的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fine, but seriously, though … a little selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.55,0:25:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是什么都得围着你转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.74,0:25:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.41,0:25:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,外边呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.35,0:25:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.10,0:25:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,开着扬声器呢 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on speaker, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.46,0:25:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam? Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.92,0:25:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你们 视如己出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you like my own. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.12,0:25:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但有时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}But sometimes…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.50,0:26:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Sometimes,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.99,0:26:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩真是我见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are the whiniest,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.37,0:26:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,最爱发牢骚 最自我中心的混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}most self-absorbed sons of bitches I ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.17,0:26:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们说我自私\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm selfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.84,0:26:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哪里自私了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.16,0:26:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你们付出了一切 所有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do everything for you … everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.36,0:26:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要我查传说资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need some lore scrounged up?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.72,0:26:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要我来救你们的小命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need your asses pulled out of the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.19,0:26:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连你们闹别扭我还得听你们诉苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need someone to bitch to about each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.72,0:26:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们啥都找我帮忙 而我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call me, and I come through …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.27,0:26:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哪次他妈的不是赴汤蹈火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every…Damn…Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.01,0:26:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果到头来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do I get for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.48,0:26:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈连个屁都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack with a side of squat!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.91,0:26:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲍比 - 老子话还没说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bobby - Do I sound like I'm done?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.95,0:26:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我听着 我知道你们有了麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, look, I know you've got issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.66,0:26:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,天知道我怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.78,0:26:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要告诉你们一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I got a news flash for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.01,0:26:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球不是绕着你们转的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't the center of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.90,0:26:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你们有没有想起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, it may have slipped your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.88,0:26:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的灵魂在克劳力手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Crowley owns my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.46,0:26:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间每分每秒在流逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the meter is running!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.92,0:26:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我就这么干等着 就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will be damned if I am gonna sit around.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.17,0:27:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得下地狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And … and be damned!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.13,0:27:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩能不能别再给我唧唧歪歪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how about you two sack up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.88,0:27:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就帮我这么一次 行不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And help me for once?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.69,0:27:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 你尽管开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, all … all you got to do is ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.37,0:27:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管要我们帮什么忙都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything you need, we're there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.47,0:27:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收到了马西·沃德的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a call from Marcy Ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.91,0:27:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来她好像遭遇了一次入侵民宅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems she had a little home invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.62,0:27:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉她说我会查 不用记录在档了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told her I'd look into it. Didn't bother filing a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.65,0:27:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.44,0:27:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你帮个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.99,0:27:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢瑟·范德罗斯来了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther Vandross turn up?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.30,0:27:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,转告一下我的仰慕之情哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him I'm a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.34,0:27:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的真名是鲁弗斯·特纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}His real name's Rufus Turner.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.70,0:27:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他因盗窃罪被关在麻省的安多弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's being held in Andover, Mass., on a burglary charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.63,0:27:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让你把他引渡到这来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need you to get him extradited here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.33,0:27:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么罪名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extradited for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.52,0:27:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谋杀罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.13,0:28:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真没说笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.60,0:28:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道引渡一名罪犯需要什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what it takes to extradite a prisoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.69,0:28:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要得到庭谕和地检官许可\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd need a court order, permission from the D.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.33,0:28:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得向各种人员进行申请\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I would have to call in every marker I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.68,0:28:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还得处理各种手续\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hand out a few to boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.94,0:28:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说还是有希望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're saying there's a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.19,0:28:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算老天保佑我们成功了 然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if by some miracle we can get him here, then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.59,0:28:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那伙计在这里面临谋杀指控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then your pal's here on a murder charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.34,0:28:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备怎么把他救出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you gonna to get him out from under that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.72,0:28:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我来担心好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me handle the "B" Side.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.56,0:28:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like you, bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.61,0:28:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,可这会让我丢了饭碗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this could nuke my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.46,0:28:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为这个镇子付出了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I've done a lot for this town …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.48,0:28:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会比你知道得更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some you know about, some you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.29,0:28:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不擅长求人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not real good at this whole "Asking for help" Thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.58,0:28:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.54,0:28:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Bobby. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.19,0:29:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,想我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.08,0:29:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么 - 别问\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did you… - Don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.57,0:29:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你一小时 之后我再报告联调局\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got one hour, and then I call the feds.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.23,0:29:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tell them he busted out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.42,0:29:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.22,0:29:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我丢了工作 老娘跟你没完\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lose my job over this, I am taking it out of your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.26,0:29:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,戒指还在你胃里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me the ring is still in your stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.06,0:29:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去煮点沸水\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go boil some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.33,0:29:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.65,0:30:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.46,0:30:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.27,0:30:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.45,0:30:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.36,0:30:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,加文·麦克劳德吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gavin Macleod?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.15,0:30:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里…\N{\fnArial\fs30}is…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.91,0:30:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是地狱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.67,0:30:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那得看你的表现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's gonna depend on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.38,0:30:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是费格斯·麦克劳德的儿子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you Fergus Macleod's boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.52,0:30:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.26,0:31:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下来好好聊聊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are gonna have a nice, long chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.02,0:31:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠 你看起来真萎靡呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you look like hammered crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.11,0:31:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是这么会挑时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're a vision, as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.73,0:31:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,老是这一套 有完没完呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't we both know how this game ends?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.00,0:31:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really, bobby…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.21,0:31:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真该消停一下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to know when to fold 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.46,0:31:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.48,0:31:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从路西法又被封印以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that ever since Lucifer went to the pokey,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.85,0:31:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是地狱的老大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the big kahuna downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.95,0:31:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看来你读过交易内容了 - 和天堂有麻烦了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I see you've been reading the trades. - Trouble in paradise?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.73,0:31:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥们 你想也想不到的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mate, you have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.59,0:31:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本以为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.56,0:31:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦我掌了权\N{\fnArial\fs30}that when I got the corner office …
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.28,0:31:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was all gonna be…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.64,0:32:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱就会变得皆大欢喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}rainbows and 2-headed puppies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.14,0:32:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if I'm being honest…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.19,0:32:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉结果还是一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.25,0:32:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也不奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought that was the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.51,0:32:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道恶魔的毛病是啥么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what the problem with demons is?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.15,0:32:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们本性难移 - 一点没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're demons? - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.29,0:32:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一帮邪恶又背信弃义的废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil, lying prats, the whole lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.09,0:32:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,又蠢又笨\N{\fnArial\fs30}And stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.94,0:32:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本想另指一条路给他们 更好的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to show them a-a new way … a better way …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.33,0:32:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果我得到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.92,0:32:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,屁都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bugger all!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.30,0:32:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 曾几何时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, there's days that I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.48,0:32:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还觉得路西法的「把所有人都变成恶魔」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer's whole "Spike anything with black eyes" Plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.71,0:32:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那计划不错呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}wasn't half bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.80,0:32:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一吐为快的感觉真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels good to get that off my chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.10,0:32:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该多来几次\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should make this a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.32,0:32:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看起来像是心理医生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look like Dr. Phil to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.22,0:32:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点像\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.63,0:32:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyhoo…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.21,0:32:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定不是叫我来做客的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously not here for a social call,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.81,0:32:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何贵干\N{\fnArial\fs30}So on with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.36,0:32:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.14,0:32:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不用重复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll save you the recap.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.55,0:32:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 不如让我帮你概括下\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I'll do the shorthand for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.40,0:33:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说 我想要回我的灵魂 混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want my soul back, idjit!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.04,0:33:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.36,0:33:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说 别逼老子来硬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm surly, and I got a beard!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.75,0:33:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,快还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gimme!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.44,0:33:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸如此类\N{\fnArial\fs30}blah, blah, blah,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.90,0:33:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你这样的乡巴佬说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homespun cornpone insult,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.24,0:33:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是侮辱了我的聪敏才智啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}witty retort from yours truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.69,0:33:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,归根结蒂就是 你什么也得不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bottom line is… You get bubkes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.89,0:33:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,说完了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we done?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.05,0:33:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,才刚开始呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.72,0:33:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,加文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gavin?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.04,0:33:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.08,0:33:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是… 好久不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-it's … it's been so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.12,0:33:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好爱你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you so …
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.63,0:33:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.77,0:33:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你的灵魂换我儿子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your soul for my boy … that's it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.85,0:33:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得不称赞你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to give you credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.67,0:33:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事你想得真妙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}for thinking outside the box on that one,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.03,0:33:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但问题是 我讨厌这小杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}But problem is, I loathe the little bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.94,0:33:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想折磨他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to torture him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.77,0:33:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我一边坐着好好欣赏吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me pull up a chair, and I'll watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.58,0:33:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧了他的尸骨 把他送来地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, burn his bones, send him down to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.91,0:33:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就可以一家团聚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can have a family reunion.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.75,0:33:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错吧 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.08,0:34:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可是选错了交易筹码 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You picked the wrong bargaining chip this time, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.39,0:34:03.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才不是筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ain't a chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.39,0:34:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是利用他 挖掘一下你的过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just using him to dig up dirt on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.73,0:34:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为加文讨厌你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since Gavin hates you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.80,0:34:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是讨厌他 而他甚至更加讨厌你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe even more than you hate him,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.50,0:34:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够一吐为快 他可是乐意至极啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was more than happy to squawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.25,0:34:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉他什么了 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you tell him, son?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.27,0:34:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.14,0:34:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我全都知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it all now…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.66,0:34:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,费格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fergus.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.10,0:34:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能现在是威风的地狱之主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you may be king of the dirtbags here,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.94,0:34:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但生前 你不过是个微不足道的裁缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in life, you were nothing but a two-bit tailor.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.98,0:34:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了五斗米而折腰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who sold his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.49,0:34:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,出卖了自己的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}In exchange for an extra 3 inches below the belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.64,0:34:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,人不为己天诛地灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to hit double digits.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.16,0:34:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.48,0:34:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是挖到了一些我的过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a glimpse behind the curtain.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.48,0:35:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.09,0:35:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.44,0:35:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你被葬在哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I know where you're planted.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.48,0:35:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.71,0:35:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.03,0:35:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见丫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.42,0:35:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啥时聚聚呗 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should get together. - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.93,0:35:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回来就能聚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to do that when I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.29,0:35:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来是啥意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.06,0:35:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.04,0:35:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和萨姆 我们在国外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Sam … we've gone international.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.77,0:35:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我们在你的老巢\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, we're in your neck of the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.53,0:35:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你过去真的穿裙子的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really used to wear a skirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.86,0:35:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是苏格兰男用短裙\N{\fnArial\fs30}A kilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.46,0:35:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有很健壮的小腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had very athletic calves.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.39,0:35:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们在搞什么鬼 - 玩骨牌呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the game? - Dominoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.27,0:35:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我们刚把你的骨头挖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, we just dug yours up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.14,0:35:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,荒唐透顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.76,0:35:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧骨头这种方法 不过是个传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole burning-bones thing … I-it's a myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.66,0:35:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的手下可不这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know an employee of yours who'd disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.24,0:35:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.83,0:35:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没认出来吗 那是你的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't recognize 'em? They're yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.24,0:36:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来她是这么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where she got to.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.48,0:36:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.24,0:36:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是自以为非比寻常\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're something special,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.17,0:36:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事实上 你们只是灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're just spirits …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.15,0:36:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,扭曲 堕落 邪恶的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twisted, perverted, evil spirits,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.85,0:36:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但归根结蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But end of the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.61,0:36:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不过是些自负的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're nothing but ghosts with an ego.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.70,0:36:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只要点燃遗骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We torch your bones,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.02,0:36:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会灰飞烟灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go up in flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.94,0:36:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear that, Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.38,0:36:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在为你点打火机呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's me flicking my bic for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.37,0:36:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的遗骨交换我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your bones for my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.97,0:36:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going once.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.97,0:36:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.34,0:36:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bollocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.95,0:37:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于我的腿你就不必做什么改动了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can go ahead and leave in the part about my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.61,0:37:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴与你做交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleasure doing business with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.67,0:37:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 要是你不介意的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you don't mind…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.25,0:37:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的遗骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe those are mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.23,0:37:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我现在怎么想不\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, now that I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.48,0:37:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干嘛不直接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'll just…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.57,0:37:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,烧了它们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Napalm your ass anyhow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.65,0:37:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.23,0:37:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a dick…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.06,0:37:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但交易要讲信用\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a deal's a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.11,0:37:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用你帮我说话 大高个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need you to fight my battles for me, moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.79,0:37:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get bent.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.68,0:38:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我得失陪一下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you'll excuse me…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.85,0:38:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有一地狱的恶魔要管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a little hell to raise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.45,0:38:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢你俩小子助我一臂之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate you boys lend a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.69,0:38:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,能这么整下克劳力那娘炮要我们怎的都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, anytime we get to punk Crowley works for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.14,0:38:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.81,0:38:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你有多么「喜欢」坐飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, knowing how much you love flying the friendly skies,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.73,0:38:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,九小时的飞行可不是盖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess a 9-hour plane trip was no picnic.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.67,0:38:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么熬过来的 把自己灌醉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you do, drink your way through it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.38,0:38:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.21,0:38:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不 一路上他吓得吐了四袋子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he white-knuckled his way through four puke bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.09,0:38:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我很清醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least I was sober.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.71,0:38:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有混蛋想轻举妄动 想也别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some nutjob decided to try something, I was ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.67,0:38:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我捏着叉子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a fork.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.09,0:38:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.47,0:38:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早先说过的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}About the things I said earlier…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.01,0:38:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时心情很差\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in a tough spot,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.37,0:38:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想我是… - 你说得没错 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and I-I guess I was … - you were right, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.80,0:38:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们太想当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take you for granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.87,0:38:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年来 都是你为我们收拾烂摊子 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been cleaning up our messes for years, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.10,0:38:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是没有你 我都不敢想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without you, I don't even want.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.95,0:39:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和萨姆会是怎么个死法\N{\fnArial\fs30}to think about where me and Sam would have ended up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.14,0:39:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这么肉麻的话还是少说点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then. Let's roll credits on this chick flick.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.26,0:39:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅途愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys have a safe flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.54,0:39:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃点儿当地美食\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, try some of the local grub.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.74,0:39:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说很有异域风情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear it's…Exotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.54,0:39:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, no, definitely, we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.08,0:39:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说这儿有奥利弗花园餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear they have an Olive Garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.77,0:39:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是威利斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Willis.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.90,0:39:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 还是我们这的精英探员呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he is. One of our best agents, in fact.
